│ `request_validation_exception_handler` and                                   │
│ `websocket_request_validation_exception_handler` to extract the necessary    │
│ metadata from the `Request` and `WebSocket` scope and attach it to the       │
│ exception object before it is raised.                                        │
│                                                                              │
│     The changes were verified against existing validation error tests,       │
│ ensuring no regressions were introduced.                                     │
│                                                                              │
